<title>ARGENTINA: SOCCER-LIBERTADORES CUP RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LIBERTADORES CUP RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sporting Cristal (Peru) beat Velez Sarsfield (Argentina) 1-0 (halftime 0-0) in a South American Libertadores Cup second round, second leg match on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Jorge Soto (88)</p>
<p>Sporting Cristal won 1-0 on aggregate.</p>
<p>Remaining matches: May 14 - Cruzeiro (Brazil) v Nacional (Ecuador), Colo Colo (Chile) v Nacional (Uruguay), Oriente Petrolero (Bolivia) v Universidad Catolica (Chile)</p>
<p>Already qualified: Bolivar (Bolivia), Gremio (Brazil), Racing Club (Argentina), Penarol (Uruguay)</p>
</text>
